WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
All mount up for me

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,640
Go to the canyon exit

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,080
Find the rest of the Northern Barbarian Snow Soldiers

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:09,520
If you follow me, we will be brothers

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:13,260
Your horse, I brought you trouble.

6
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,020
No trouble, no trouble, I say brother

7
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,860
Did you do this?

8
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,320
Just go and take a look and you will know.

9
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,730
This snow soldier is quite keen

10
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,110
I don't mind stabbing my head either

11
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,430
Give yourself a sense of presence

12
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,750
At the same time, save yourself a little trouble

13
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,090
This scent of blood

14
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:35,970
It's heavier than what we just killed

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,360
Could it be that what Xue Bing said is true?

16
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:42,010
How many people were killed?

17
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:45,840
Where is the battlefield

18
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,760
It's clearly a wave of minced flesh and blood

19
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,900
The recruit smiled at me

20
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:54,140
But this smile is paired with a face full of writing

21
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,420
Why did you steal a piece of evil art?
